; SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; match.weave — exhaustive tagged-variant match
;
; (match ENUM VALUE (case CTOR [BIND] EXPR)* ) with an optional final
; (case _ EXPR) wildcard. Missing constructors without a wildcard, and a
; wildcard after every constructor, are errors. Lowering is an if-chain
; over variant tags; match is an expression only as a let initializer or
; a returned value.

(program
  (name "match")
  (version "0.1")

  (fn mat_error
